                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi isikhathi sesihambile, abafundi bakhe beza kuye, bathi: Lindawo iyinkangala, lesikhathi sesihambile; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badabulele ukuze baye emaphandleni lasemizini ezingelezileyo, bazithengele ukudla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaphendula wathi kibo: Banikeni lina ukudla. Bathi kuye: Sihambe yini, siyethenga izinkwa zamadola angamatshumi amabili, sibaphe badle na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kubo: Lilezinkwa ezingaki na? Hambani liyebona. Sebebonile bathi kuye: Zinhlanu, lenhlanzi ezimbili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabalaya ukuba bonke bahlale phansi ngamaxuku otshanini obuluhlaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebehlala phansi izigaba ngezigaba, ngamakhulu langamatshumi amahlanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathatha izinkwa ezinhlanu lenhlanzi ezimbili, ekhangela ezulwini, wabonga, wazihlephula izinkwa, wazinika abafundi bakhe ukuba bazibeke phambi kwabo; lenhlanzi ezimbili wababela bonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badla bonke, basutha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babutha imvuthuluka yezinkwa, izitsha ezilitshumi lambili zagcwala, leyenhlanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo abadlayo izinkwa babengamadoda azinkulungwane ezinhlanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masinyane wacindezela abafundi bakhe ukuba bangene emkolweni bamandulele ukuya ngaphetsheya eBetsayida, esadabulela ixuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esebavalelisile wasuka waya entabeni ukuyakhuleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sekuhlwile, umkolo wawusolwandle, yena wayeyedwa emhlabathini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wababona behlupheka kakhulu ekugwedleni, ngoba umoya wawuphambene labo; weza kubo ngesikhathi somlindo wesine wobusuku ehamba phezu kolwandle. Wayezakubadlula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebembonile ehamba phezu kolwandle, bacabanga ukuba yisipuku; bakhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba bambona bonke, bethuka. Kodwa wakhuluma labo masinyane, wathi kubo: Manini isibindi; yimi, lingesabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasengena kubo emkolweni, umoya wathula; bamangala kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba babengaqedisisanga ngezinkwa, inhliziyo zabo zazilukhuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebewelile bafika eGenesaretha, bawubophela umkolo okhunjini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathi sebephumile emkolweni, abantu bahle bamazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagijimela kulo lonke lelolizwe, baqala ukuletha kuye abagulayo ngamathala, lapho abamuzwa ukuba ukhona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loba ngaphi lapho aya khona, emizaneni lasemizini lasemaphandleni, babeka abagulayo emidangeni, bamncenga ukuba bathinte loba umphetho wengubo yakhe nje; bonke abamthintayo basiliswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
